ngton Wizards at 7 p.m. for Breast Cancer Awareness Night presented by Cleveland Clinic. The night honors survivors, caregivers and families who have been touched by breast cancer. ","timestamp":1793106518000,"date":"2026-10-27T13:08:38Z","modified":"2026-10-27T13:09:30Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1158729","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/10/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-16-1.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1158729","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/10/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-16-1.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Gameday,Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","gameday":"Gameday","releases":"Releases"},"tags":{"2026-27-season":"2026-27 Season"},"games":{"0022600133":"10/28/2026 WAS@CLE 0022600133"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"Dressed in pink, Cleveland will honor breast cancer patients, survivors and caregivers with a standing ovation. Cleveland Cavaliers vs. Washington Wizards Rocket Arena Wednesday, October 28 at 7:00 p.m. ET","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1158474,"type":"article","name":"releases-impact-academy-261019","title":"Cleveland Cavaliers Introduce 2026-27 Social Impact Academy Cohort","status":"publish","slug":"releases-impact-academy-261019","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-impact-academy-261019","excerpt":"CLEVELAND – Today, the Cleveland Cavaliers introduced the second cohort of the Cavaliers Social Impact Academy, continuing a program built to develop leadership and community advocacy skills among Cuyahoga County high school juniors and seniors. Following the same structure as the inaugural year, the cohort will complete eight dynamic workshops from now through April 2027, culminating in capstone presentations, where students identify where they can make the greatest social impact in their communities.","timestamp":1792418084000,"date":"2026-10-19T13:54:44Z","modified":"2026-10-19T13:54:44Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1158477","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/10/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-13-1.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1158477","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/10/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-13-1.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","releases":"Releases"},"tags":{"2026-27-impact-academy":"2026-27 Impact Academy","2026-27-season":"2026-27 Season"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"24 Cuyahoga County high school juniors and seniors selected for second class of academy dedicated to developing leaders of social impact in Northeast Ohio","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1158435,"type":"article","name":"releases-wine-and-gold-gala-261014","title":"Cavaliers Community Foundation Wine and Gold Gala Presented by KeyBank Raises $1.4 Million and Turns Three Local Students’ Dreams into Reality","status":"publish","slug":"releases-wine-and-gold-gala-261014","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-wine-and-gold-gala-261014","excerpt":"On Saturday, October 10, 2026, the Cavaliers Community Foundation (CCF) filled Rocket Arena with 600 community leaders, partners and guests to support youth and families across Northeast Ohio for the fifth annual Wine and Gold Gala presented by KeyBank.","timestamp":1792000931000,"date":"2026-10-14T18:02:11Z","modified":"2026-11-11T16:47:42Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1158436","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/10/Image-7.jpeg","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1350,"height":760},"anchor":"","focalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5},"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1158436","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/10/Image-7.jpeg","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1350,"height":760},"anchor":"","focalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5},"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","releases":"Releases"},"tags":{"2026-27-season":"2026-27 Season"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"Fifth Edition of the Foundation’s Annual Gala Brings Five-Year Fundraising Total to More than $5 Million","featuredMediaContentGrid":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1158436","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/10/Image-7.jpeg","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1350,"height":760},"anchor":"","focalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5},"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}}},"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1158170,"type":"article","name":"releases-community-foundation-260930","title":"Cavaliers Community Foundation and Monsters Community Foundation Award $1.175 Million to Northeast Ohio Nonprofits","status":"publish","slug":"releases-community-foundation-260930","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-community-foundation-260930","excerpt":"CLEVELAND – The Cavaliers Community Foundation (CCF) and Cleveland Monsters Community Foundation (MCF) today announced $1,175,000 in combined grants to ten nonprofit organizations serving Northeast Ohio. The cycle introduces CCF's first-ever legacy grants, marking a shift from one-time giving to sustained, multi-year investment in Cleveland's neighborhoods.","timestamp":1790777149000,"date":"2026-09-30T14:05:49Z","modified":"2026-09-30T14:05:49Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1158172","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/09/fjrsdiofrjhiejsio.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1158172","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/09/fjrsdiofrjhiejsio.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","releases":"Releases"},"tags":{"2026-27-season":"2026-27 Season","cavaliers-community-foundation":"Cavaliers Community Foundation","monsters-community-foundation":"Monsters Community Foundation"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"Cavaliers Community Foundation launches first-ever multi-year commitment, distributing three-year grants to five Cleveland non-profits","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1158101,"type":"article","name":"releases-trees-for-threes-planting-260922","title":"Cleveland Cavaliers and Davey Tree Complete Annual “Trees for Threes” Commitment by Planting 600 Trees at Cleveland Metroparks Zoo","status":"publish","slug":"releases-trees-for-threes-planting-260922","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-trees-for-threes-planting-260922","excerpt":"CLEVELAND – Today, the Cleveland Cavaliers, in partnership with The Davey Tree Expert Company, hosted their annual Trees for Threes event at the Cleveland Metroparks Zoo, planting one tree for every three-pointer made by the Cavaliers during regular season home games at Rocket Arena.","timestamp":1790096492000,"date":"2026-09-22T17:01:32Z","modified":"2026-09-22T17:01:32Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1158102","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/09/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-12.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1158102","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/09/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-12.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","releases":"Releases"},"tags":{"2026-27-season":"2026-27 Season"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"Volunteers Planted One Tree for Every Three-Pointer Made by the Cavaliers at Rocket Arena during the 2025-26 NBA Regular Season","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1505,"name":"cleblewis"}},{"id":1158006,"type":"article","name":"releases-john-adams-refurbished-260917","title":"Cleveland Cavaliers and Ohio Cat Debut Refurbished Basketball Court at John Adams College and Career Academy","status":"publish","slug":"releases-john-adams-refurbished-260917","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-john-adams-refurbished-260917","excerpt":"CLEVELAND – The Cleveland Cavaliers, in partnership with Ohio Cat, debuted a refurbished basketball court at John Adams College \u0026 Career Academy in tandem with Metropolitan School District’s (CMSD) annual Fathers Matter Walk. This stands as the third court renovated under the five-year commitment between the Cavaliers and Ohio Cat, furthering the shared commitment to build safe environments for communities to gather, grow and thrive.  ","timestamp":1789666166000,"date":"2026-09-17T17:29:26Z","modified":"2026-09-17T18:01:05Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1158007","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/09/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-9.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5},"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1158007","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/09/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-9.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5},"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","releases":"Releases"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"This marks the largest, stand-alone court renovation the Cavaliers have completed to date.","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1157967,"type":"article","name":"releases-gwc-stem-260908","title":"Cleveland Cavaliers and SERVPRO Team Fosdick Unveil Renovated Basketball Court at George Washington Carver STEM School","status":"publish","slug":"releases-gwc-stem-260908","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-gwc-stem-260908","excerpt":"CLEVELAND – The Cleveland Cavaliers and SERVPRO Team Fosdick teamed up again to renovate the basketball court at George Washington Carver STEM School (GWC). This marks the second court that the Cavaliers and SERVPRO Team Fosdick have restored under their multiyear partnership. ","timestamp":1788888607000,"date":"2026-09-08T17:30:07Z","modified":"2026-09-08T17:30:07Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1157971","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/09/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-7.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1157971","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/09/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-7.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","releases":"Releases"},"tags":{"2026-27-season":"2026-27 Season"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"Cavaliers and SERVPRO Team Fosdick present new court as Cleveland’s Central neighborhood school welcomes record enrollment","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1157697,"type":"article","name":"releases-tobc-260717","title":"Cleveland Cavaliers, Black CoLabs, NAACP Cleveland and Aramark Sports + Entertainment Crown Six Black Owned Businesses Winners at A Taste of Black Cleveland 8.0","status":"publish","slug":"releases-tobc-260717","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-tobc-260717","excerpt":"Cleveland Cavaliers, Black CoLabs, NAACP Cleveland and Aramark Sports + Entertainment named Freshlyfe, House of Creole, Kake Kutters, Mama Joyce’s Soul Food, Soul City B-B-Q and We Want Smoke BBQ winners at A Taste of Black Cleveland: The Food Showcase 8.0 on Thursday, July 16, at Rocket Arena. The annual event provides a spotlight for more than 20 small Black-owned businesses to feature their most popular and innovative dishes.","timestamp":1784304461000,"date":"2026-07-17T16:07:41Z","modified":"2026-07-17T16:07:41Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1157698","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/07/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-4.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1157698","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/07/Untitled-16_9-Landscape-4.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Press Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","press-releases":"Press Releases"},"tags":{"2026-27-season":"2026-27 Season","cavaliers-community-foundation":"Cavaliers Community Foundation","taste-of-black-cleveland":"Taste of Black Cleveland","tobc":"TOBC"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"Winning Chefs were awarded $1,500 on stage in front of a sold-out crowd","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1157531,"type":"article","name":"releases-meet-me-here-opening-260619","title":"Cleveland Cavaliers Celebrate Grand Opening of 2016 Championship Commemorative Basketball Court at Meet Me Here Plaza","status":"publish","slug":"releases-meet-me-here-opening-260619","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-meet-me-here-opening-260619","excerpt":"On Friday, June 19, the Cleveland Cavaliers, in partnership with the City of Cleveland and Downtown Cleveland Inc., hosted the grand opening of the 2016 NBA Championship commemorative outdoor basketball court at Meet Me Here Plaza. Located across from Rocket Arena on Huron Road between East 4th Street and Ontario Street, the reimagined plaza features a new outdoor basketball court, walkways and seating designed to bring people together before, during and beyond Cavaliers game nights. Centered around the iconic “Meet Me Here” letters that have defined the corner of Ontario and Huron since 1994, the plaza reflects the Cavs’ ongoing commitment to wellness, recreation and community investment while serving as a year-round destination at the intersection of sports, entertainment and community. ","timestamp":1781893351000,"date":"2026-06-19T18:22:31Z","modified":"2026-06-19T20:38:49Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1157534","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/06/DSC08786.jpeg","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":3000,"height":1687},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1157534","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/06/DSC08786.jpeg","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":3000,"height":1687},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Press Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","press-releases":"Press Releases"},"tags":{"2016-championship":"2016 Championship","2025-26-season":"2025-26 Season","meet-me-here":"Meet Me Here"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"Cavs-branded professional basketball court serves as anchor for new, permanent community asset in the heart of Downtown Cleveland across from Rocket Arena Cavs.com/meetmehere","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1157461,"type":"article","name":"releases-tobc-lineup-260601","title":"A Taste of Black Cleveland: The Food Showcase 8.0 Welcomes 28 Chefs and Restaurateurs in Culinary Competition","status":"publish","slug":"releases-tobc-lineup-260601","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-tobc-lineup-260601","excerpt":"The Cleveland Cavaliers, Cleveland NAACP, Black CoLabs and Aramark Sports + Entertainment announce the lineup of local Black chefs and restaurateurs set to compete at A Taste of Black Cleveland: The Food Showcase 8.0 at Rocket Arena on July 16.","timestamp":1781200700000,"date":"2026-06-11T17:58:20Z","modified":"2026-06-11T17:58:20Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1157503","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/06/Top-Story-1920x1080-1.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1157503","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/06/Top-Story-1920x1080-1.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Press Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","press-releases":"Press Releases"},"tags":{"community":"community","taste-of-black-cleveland":"Taste of Black Cleveland","tobc":"TOBC"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"Tickets Available NOW at rocketarena.com/tobc8 July 16 at Rocket Arena 6:00 – 10:00 p.m.","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1157467,"type":"article","name":"releases-all-for-fun-tour-260603","title":"Cleveland Cavaliers Announce Summer Schedule for All For Fun Tour","status":"publish","slug":"releases-all-for-fun-tour-260603","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-all-for-fun-tour-260603","excerpt":"CLEVELAND – The Cleveland Cavaliers All For Fun Tour is bringing the energy of Cavs basketball to fans across Ohio and Western Pennsylvania all summer long, as the interactive mobile trailer gears up to hit the road. The tour will make stops at community festivals, youth-focused events, college campuses and local celebrations, delivering high-energy experiences, exclusive giveaways and Cavaliers pride to fans of all ages.","timestamp":1780495292000,"date":"2026-06-03T14:01:32Z","modified":"2026-06-03T14:01:50Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1157468","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/06/16x9.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"id":"1157468","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/1610612739/2026/06/16x9.png","alt":"","caption":"","captionAlignment":"","captionColor":"","copyright":"","credit":"","link":"","align":"","size":{"width":1920,"height":1080},"anchor":"","focalPoint":[],"direction":"ltr","animation":{"name":"none"}},"category":"Community,Press Releases,Releases","language":"en","taxonomy":{"categories":{"community":"Community","press-releases":"Press Releases","releases":"Releases"},"tags":{"2025-26-season":"2025-26 Season","all-for-fun-tour":"All For Fun Tour"},"teams":{"1610612739":"Cleveland Cavaliers"}},"attributes":{"hideAuthor":false,"hideTimestamp":false,"relatedContent":{"source":"manual","sourceId":null,"content":[]},"subhead":"The interactive fan experience trailer will travel across Ohio and Western Pennsylvania all summer, bringing Cavs basketball and energy directly to communities. Full Schedule at Cavs.com/AllForFunTour","featuredMediaContentGrid":null,"hideContent":false,"nbaId":{"restricted":false}},"syndication":{"platforms":{"app":true,"web":true}},"author":{"id":1033,"name":"Cavaliers"}},{"id":1156407,"type":"article","name":"releases-social-impact-academy-260501","title":"Cleveland Cavaliers Host Graduation for Inaugural Class of the Cavaliers Social Impact Academy","status":"publish","slug":"releases-social-impact-academy-260501","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/cavaliers/news/releases-social-impact-academy-260501","excerpt":"The Cleveland Cavaliers hosted the graduation ceremony for the inaugural class of the Cavaliers Social Impact Academy, honoring 20 high school students from Cuyahoga County schools who demonstrate leadership and a commitment to positive social impact. From September through April, the cohort participated in the first-of-its-kind initiative, completing eight dynamic workshops that concluded in capstone project presentations informed by knowledge gathered throughout the program. ","timestamp":1777658259000,"date":"2026-05-01T17:57:39Z","modified":"2026-05-01T17:57:39Z","featuredImage":{"type":"image","html":null,"text":null,"attributes":{"id":"1156408","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/teams/uploads/sites/16106127